# Imported inside the relay.dedseckms.ru site block (/opt/relay/caddy/relay.caddy):
#   import /opt/vpn/caddy/vpn.caddy
# Rendered on the server into /opt/vpn/caddy/vpn.caddy (0644 root: the caddy user must read it)
# with SUB_PATH from /opt/vpn/.secrets. s-ui subPath equals this path, so no rewrite.
# The s-ui admin panel is NOT exposed: owner uses an SSH tunnel to 127.0.0.1:2095,
# hub reaches the API over the docker network (http://mineded-vpn:2095/...).
handle /__SUB_PATH__/* {
	@write not method GET HEAD
	respond @write 405
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:2096
}
